{
  "comment": [
    "Shared table for the thread state derivation. Consumed by",
    "internal/threadtools/state_test.go (TestStateFixture). Each case also",
    "states the frontend's input, so a Vitest test of",
    "resolveEffectiveThreadStatus in frontend/src/lib/utils/threadStatusPill.ts",
    "can run the same table and the two cannot drift.",
    "",
    "Schema: {comment: string[], cases: Case[]}.",
    "Case = {",
    "  name: string,",
    "  thread: {hasOpenTurn, hasIncompleteTurn, hasFailedTurn,",
    "    hasActionableProposedPlan: boolean, worktreeSetupState: string},",
    "  live: {activeTurn, pendingSends: boolean, pendingApprovals,",
    "    pendingUserInputs: number},   // Go input, threadtools.LiveState",
    "  liveStatus: string,             // frontend input, ThreadLiveStatus,",
    "                                  // what getThreadStatus derives",
    "  want: string                    // the effective state both must return",
    "}",
    "",
    "The Go test feeds thread and live to State. The frontend test feeds",
    "liveStatus and the thread fields a thread row carries to the frontend",
    "(all but hasOpenTurn) to resolveEffectiveThreadStatus. Both must",
    "produce want. liveStatus is derived from the live fields the frontend",
    "also receives, by the order the Go function uses: pending-approval,",
    "awaiting-input, running for activeTurn or pendingSends, else idle.",
    "hasOpenTurn is Go's alone: an open row with no live round is a Go-only",
    "case (state_test.go). hasIncompleteTurn is an interruption the user has",
    "not read: a settled one, or a turn whose end the store did not take,",
    "which reads as the boot sweep will record it. An open row of a running",
    "turn never sets it, so the two never hold together."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "quiet thread is idle",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "idle",
      "want": "idle"
    },
    {
      "name": "open turn is running",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": true, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": true, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "running",
      "want": "running"
    },
    {
      "name": "queued send before its echo is running",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": true, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "running",
      "want": "running"
    },
    {
      "name": "pending approval outranks an open turn",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": true, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": true, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 1, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "pending-approval",
      "want": "pending-approval"
    },
    {
      "name": "pending approval outranks a question to the user",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": true, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": true, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 1, "pendingUserInputs": 2},
      "liveStatus": "pending-approval",
      "want": "pending-approval"
    },
    {
      "name": "question to the user is awaiting-input",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": true, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": true, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 1},
      "liveStatus": "awaiting-input",
      "want": "awaiting-input"
    },
    {
      "name": "a blocked provider outranks a failed worktree setup",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": true, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": "failed"},
      "live": {"activeTurn": true, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 1, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "pending-approval",
      "want": "pending-approval"
    },
    {
      "name": "failed worktree setup is the first durable fallback",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": true, "hasFailedTurn": true, "hasActionableProposedPlan": true, "worktreeSetupState": "failed"},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "idle",
      "want": "setup-failed"
    },
    {
      "name": "a running worktree setup is not a fallback",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": "running"},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "idle",
      "want": "idle"
    },
    {
      "name": "failed turn comes before interrupted",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": true, "hasFailedTurn": true, "hasActionableProposedPlan": true, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "idle",
      "want": "error"
    },
    {
      "name": "interrupted comes before plan-ready",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": true, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": true, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "idle",
      "want": "interrupted"
    },
    {
      "name": "actionable plan is plan-ready",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": true, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "idle",
      "want": "plan-ready"
    },
    {
      "name": "a live turn masks every durable fallback",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": true, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": true, "hasActionableProposedPlan": true, "worktreeSetupState": "failed"},
      "live": {"activeTurn": true, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "running",
      "want": "running"
    },
    {
      "name": "a turn whose round ended is running while its row settles",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": true, "hasIncompleteTurn": false, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": true, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "running",
      "want": "running"
    },
    {
      "name": "a send after an interruption is running",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": true, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": true, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "running",
      "want": "running"
    },
    {
      "name": "a settled interruption is interrupted",
      "thread": {"hasOpenTurn": false, "hasIncompleteTurn": true, "hasFailedTurn": false, "hasActionableProposedPlan": false, "worktreeSetupState": ""},
      "live": {"activeTurn": false, "pendingSends": false, "pendingApprovals": 0, "pendingUserInputs": 0},
      "liveStatus": "idle",
      "want": "interrupted"
    }
  ]
}
